The project tier needs a `.booping` marker to attach: with no marker in the cwd the run still
succeeds, resolving core plus global while a config.yaml sitting in a would-be vault is ignored.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  sprint:
    default_threshold_sp: 3
-- cmd --
booping config-get core.sprint.default_threshold_sp
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
35
-- stderr --
